            <title>[LU-20340] Recursive option to 'lfs setstripe'</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20340</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;It could be useful to add a recursive option to 'lfs setstripe', so that the striping pattern is set for the specified directory and all existing subdirectories. There is no point in trying to set the striping pattern on existing regular files, as it cannot be changed after files are created.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
